<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.Illumina.CellularAI</RootNamespace>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <AssemblyTitle>CellularAI: Predicting single-cell responses to genetic perturbations</AssemblyTitle>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <IncludeSymbols>True</IncludeSymbols>
    <Title>CellularAI: Predicting single-cell responses to genetic perturbations</Title>
    <Description>CellularAI is an algorithm designed to predict transcriptome-wide responses to genetic perturbations in unseen cell types and is the winning method of the [Virtual Cell Challenge 2026](https://virtualcellchallenge.org/leaderboard). Given control cells from a new cellular context and a list of genetic perturbations, it estimates how those cells respond to each perturbation and synthesizes non-negative integer-count single cells for every target. This package is the pure CPU, in-memory implementation of the seven-stage pipeline (summary pooling, response plan, control-residual correction, totals design, count synthesis, scoring and gating); it performs no file IO and leaves parquet / h5ad / vcc handling to the calling application.</Description>
    <PackageId>CellularAI</PackageId>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://gcmodeller.org/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/SMRUCC/GCModeller.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <RepositoryType>git</RepositoryType>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>GPL-3.0-or-later</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>True</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
    <Copyright>Copyright © SMRUCC genomics, GuiLin China, 2026</Copyright>
    <Authors>xieguigang&lt;xie.guigang@gcmodeller.org&gt;</Authors>
    <Company>SMRUCC genomics institute</Company>
    <Product>GCModeller</Product>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);1591</NoWarn>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageTags>Illumina;cellularai;virtual-cell;single-cell;perturbation;transcriptome;meta-analysis;random-effects;stouffer;randomized-svd;truncated-pca;ridge-regression;copula;wilcoxon;count-synthesis;gcmodeller</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>This cycle: first CPU release of the CellularAI reproduction. Added the seven-stage in-memory pipeline: Summary pooling (row x perturbation x record weighted DerSimonian-Laird tau2, inverse-variance weights relative floor, weighted mean log2FC, Stouffer combination, guard counters); Planning (similarity weights with softmax and a water-filling weight cap, plan z / similarity z / x_sim, curve sizes with power reshuffle and similarity lift, call selection excluding the own target); Residual correction (randomized SVD response basis with own-target replacement, per-gene multi-response ridge with row masking, bounded-ratio and sign preserving shaping); Totals design (profile spread, secant/bisection margin solver, control PCs, control-program smoothing and program weighting, largest-remainder integer totals, fixed-point credit solve); Count synthesis (seeded reproducible random source with per-perturbation CRC32 seeds, quantile builder with exact mass conservation and sparsification, exact Wilcoxon z kernel, shift bisection, copula correlation search with overshoot repair and rank-neutral demotion, burst scattering for low expression genes); Scoring (DE table with exact rank sum and BH, six VCC metrics with anchor scaling); and gating via ContextPipeline returning a CsrMatrix plus a PredictionReport. Added a sibling DebugAudit test project covering M0 to M7.</PackageReleaseNotes>
    <AssemblyName>SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.Illumina.CellularAI</AssemblyName>
    <Platforms>AnyCPU;x64</Platforms>
    <Configurations>Debug;Release;Rsharp_app_release</Configurations>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="test\**" />
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="test\**" />
    <None Remove="test\**" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="README.md" Pack="true" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\runtime\sciBASIC#\Data_science\Mathematica\Math\Math.Statistics\stats-netcore5.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\runtime\sciBASIC#\Data_science\Mathematica\Math\DataFittings\linear-netcore5.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\runtime\sciBASIC#\Data_science\Mathematica\Math\Math\Math.NET5.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\runtime\sciBASIC#\Microsoft.VisualBasic.Core\src\Core.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\..\workbench\modules\ExperimentDesigner\designer-netcore5.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\analysis\HTS_matrix\HTS_matrix-netcore5.vbproj" />
    <ProjectReference Include="..\..\..\core\Bio.Assembly\biocore-netcore5.vbproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
